OL,3,GNEWSADog suffering severe infection
OL,4,Asaved by rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA foster dog rescue helped save a
OL,7,Fbulldog suffering from a severe
OL,8,Fbacterial infection which had spread
OL,9,Facross his body.
OL,11,FGemma Kirby, founder of New Leash of
OL,12,FLife in Coventry, said George came into
OL,13,Fthe organisation's care around six
OL,14,Fweeks ago after his owner was no longer
OL,15,Fable to care for him or get him to
OL,16,Fveterinary appointments.
OL,18,FThe seven-year-old dog is now on the
OL,19,Froad to recovery and looking for a new
OL,20,Fhome.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
