OL,3,GNEWSADog suffering severe infection
OL,4,Asaved by rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rescue recently helped another dog
OL,7,FTrevor, a five-year-old Labrador, after
OL,8,Fhis owners asked a veterinary practice
OL,9,Fin Nuneaton to put him to sleep because
OL,10,Fhe was too energetic around children.
OL,11,FIt currently has about 15 dogs in
OL,12,Ffoster homes and said dog abandonment
OL,13,Fcases were rising.
